foo               "foo" literally
\K                reset the match start here (drop what matched so far)
ba                "ba" literally
r++               "r" literally, 1 or more (possessive)
(…)               capture group #1
├─ \(             "(" literally
├─ (?:…)*         non-capturing group, 0 or more (greedy)
│  └─ [^()]|(?1)  one of 2 alternatives
│     ├─ [^()]    any char except: (, )
│     └─ (?1)     recurse into group #1
└─ \)             ")" literally
(?R)?             recurse into the whole pattern, 0 or 1 (greedy)
